# Drawn VS race: run tests/input/vs-first-race.input with no further input until the race times out
# (both NO TIME), then advance past the result and the REMATCH banner (which waits for a button) (tools/probe_vs_challenger.py).
wait 38200
dump vsd-result
press a 2
wait 120
dump vsd-rematch
press a 2
wait 120
dump vsd-after
quit
